      "source": "When configured as the last interceptor in a chain, it allows the component\nsending the message to leave headers mutable for interceptors to modify prior\nto the message actually being sent and exposed to concurrent access.",
      "translation": "当配置为拦截器链中的最后一个拦截器时，它允许发送消息的组件在消息实际发送之前暴露给并发访问之前，使拦截器能够修改可变的标头。",
      "count": 2
    },
